    "title": "2.2 magnitude earthquake hits Madha in Oman, no effect felt in UAE",
    "text": "The tremor was not felt in the UAE and had no impact on residents\nThe tremor was recorded at a depth of 5 km in Madha - Oman at 5.13am UAE time, according to the NCM’s National Seismic Network.\nThe tremor was not felt in the UAE and had no impact on residents, the NCM confirmed.\nSign up for the Daily Briefing\nGet the latest news and updates straight to your inbox",
